{
  "_id": "3JmLPBKZIL5sK74npgc0DlIbKvQ",
  "_type": "Doc",
  "_index": "aK",
  "title": "Dialog",
  "navigationTitle": "",
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "A modal window on top of the page that asks for a decision or collects input. DialogTrigger opens it and DialogClose closes it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentExampleBlock",
      "_id": "3JmLPBIF5gz3x3D3blVFXddPfQE",
      "example": "Dialog"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Confirm a destructive action"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "confirm-a-destructive-action"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Use `role=\"alertdialog\"` for a decision editors have to make. With `dismissable={false}` a click outside the dialog doesn't close it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentExampleBlock",
      "_id": "3JmLPHEbDZfe7KXohCYXJPB0dJK",
      "example": "DialogAlert"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Controlled"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "controlled"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Pass `open` and `onOpenChange` to open a dialog from anywhere, and close it once a change is saved. `useDialog` gives the content of a dialog its open state and a `close` function."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentExampleBlock",
      "_id": "3JmLPDrYIcLHVsc5c38THXsBEUq",
      "example": "DialogForm"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Submit a form"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "submit-a-form"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Pass `onSubmit` to DialogContent to render its content as a "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Form",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3KdUIotR1rHR8TNvsmlRCk3YjDo",
              "_link": "entry",
              "_entry": "3KdUIqjhk43irg9yIcQtrzg0jr3"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": ": a Button with `type=\"submit\"` submits it with the values of the named fields. The dialog closes once `onSubmit` resolves without errors. Errors it returns, keyed by field name, show on the fields and keep the dialog open. `onClose` on Dialog runs whenever the dialog closes, after `onOpenChange(false)`, for example to reset state. The form takes no room of its own (`display: contents`): put spacing such as a `gap` on DialogContent."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentExampleBlock",
      "_id": "3KdUIngTViA7dNdOcB7LFDRlJT0",
      "example": "DialogSubmit"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Props"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "props"
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentPropsBlock",
      "_id": "3JmLPEm92wSgFgjAHZBWd68xihe",
      "component": "Dialog"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Accessibility"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "accessibility"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Focus moves into the dialog when it opens and returns to the trigger when it closes. Focus stays inside while it is open, Escape closes it and the page behind it is hidden from screen readers."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
